      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Join Our Team"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Rotozest, we believe that success starts with our people. We’re always looking for talented, passionate, and driven individuals to join our team. Our employees are at the heart of everything we do, and we pride ourselves on fostering an environment of growth, innovation, and opportunity.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Why Choose Us For Your Growth?"
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/innovation-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "innovation",
      "title": "innovation",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Growth and Development"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "We are committed to helping you reach your full potential. Whether through hands-on experience, mentoring, professional development programs.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/badge-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "badge",
      "title": "badge",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Inclusive Work Environment"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Rotozest, we value diversity and inclusion. We believe that bringing together people from all walks of life leads to creativity and innovation.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/global-marketing-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "global-marketing",
      "title": "global-marketing",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Work with Purpose"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Our mission is to deliver high-quality rotary gear pumps. When you join our team, you’re not just doing a job—you’re contributing to something meaningful and impactful.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Our Core Value"
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/integration-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "integration",
      "title": "integration",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Integrity"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "We uphold the highest standards of honesty and transparency in everything we do.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/innovation-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
